# Language rows, photo tips sheets (TC-017, TC-018, TC-026 … one per language): opens each card's photo tips sheet in
# card order, reads it, swipes the second (Avoid) row left to its third item, closes it with the bottom button.
# Starts: Cinematic Reel Creator template page on card 6 (where lang-cards.steps ends; the pager loops, so five drags
# back from any other card do not reach card 1; lang-check.ts moves to card 6 first), no sheet open.
# Ends: template page on card 6, no sheet open. Picks no photo, uses no credits.
# Args: $1 = case ID. Per card: `shot …-openN` and `els` (sheet open, row not swiped), `els tip` and `shot …-sheetN`
# (after the swipe), then `els tv_title` and `shot …-closedN` (closed).
# Coordinates (Sony XQ-BT52, 1080 × 2520, 16.9.0 2611201): chip at 315,306 on the centred card; Avoid row at y 1870.
case $1
drag 250 1000 800 1000
drag 250 1000 800 1000
drag 250 1000 800 1000
drag 250 1000 800 1000
drag 250 1000 800 1000
wait 1
tap 315 306
wait 1
shot $1-open1
els
fingerdrag 900 1870 200 1870
wait 1
els tip
shot $1-sheet1
id btn_cine_story_photo_tips_got_it
wait 1
els tv_title
shot $1-closed1
drag 800 1000 250 1000
wait 1
tap 315 306
wait 1
shot $1-open2
els
fingerdrag 900 1870 200 1870
wait 1
els tip
shot $1-sheet2
id btn_cine_story_photo_tips_got_it
wait 1
els tv_title
shot $1-closed2
drag 800 1000 250 1000
wait 1
tap 315 306
wait 1
shot $1-open3
els
fingerdrag 900 1870 200 1870
wait 1
els tip
shot $1-sheet3
id btn_cine_story_photo_tips_got_it
wait 1
els tv_title
shot $1-closed3
drag 800 1000 250 1000
wait 1
tap 315 306
wait 1
shot $1-open4
els
fingerdrag 900 1870 200 1870
wait 1
els tip
shot $1-sheet4
id btn_cine_story_photo_tips_got_it
wait 1
els tv_title
shot $1-closed4
drag 800 1000 250 1000
wait 1
tap 315 306
wait 1
shot $1-open5
els
fingerdrag 900 1870 200 1870
wait 1
els tip
shot $1-sheet5
id btn_cine_story_photo_tips_got_it
wait 1
els tv_title
shot $1-closed5
